     The mmaaxxrrttcc driver supports the Maxim DS1307 and DS1339 real-time clock
     chips, which provide a low-power, full binary-coded decimal (BCD)
     clock/calendar.  In addition, the DS1307 comes with 56 bytes of NV SRAM.

